# Autocomplete

Get search suggestions through the current transport.

```svelte
<script>
  import Chemical from "chemicaljs/Chemical";

  let chemical = $state();

  async function getSuggestions() {
    await chemical.autocomplete("math"))
  }
</script>

<Chemical
  bind:this={chemical}
/>
```

## Parsing Data

Results are return in json format with `plain` and `rich` results from Google and `math` for math results.

```js
[
    {
        "type": "math",
        "data": {
            "equation": "1+1",
            "result": "2",
        }
    },
    {
        "type": "plain",
        "data": [
            {
                "text": "g",
                "highlight": false
            },
            {
                "text": "mail",
                "highlight": true
            }
        ],
        "fullURL": "gmail"
    },
    {
        "type": "rich",
        "data": {
            "title": "Google",
            "description: "Search the world's information, including webpages, images, videos and more. Google has many special features to help you find exactly what you're looking for.", //Optional
            "image": "data:image/png;base64" //Optional
        }
    },
]
```